{%- doc -%}
Sengefabrikken: Anyday price widget ("Betal med Anyday"). It reads the price shown on the page and opens Anyday's price
calculator (pay in full, in 4 or in more instalments) on click. It follows the price element, so it updates when the
variant, the size or the cart changes.

@param {string} price_selector - CSS selector of the element with the price
@param {string} page - "product" or "cart"
{%- enddoc -%}

<script src="https://my.anyday.io/price-widget/anyday-price-widget.js" type="module" async></script>
<anyday-price-widget class="anyday-price-widget" token="d64dfc5f010f4d2c976b1e93d300d8df" price-selector="{{ price_selector | escape }}" page="{{ page | default: 'product' }}" locale="da-DK" price-format-locale="da-DK" theme="light" size="small" inherit-font="true"></anyday-price-widget>
